title: "avatar-speed: real-time avatar render speed by device"
abstract: >-
  Seconds of avatar video rendered per second (× real time), end to end from speech audio in to
  frame out, one session, unpaced; each figure is the slowest of three quiet runs on the published
  release. Copied from https://docs.bithuman.ai/performance.json.
